<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:34:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>电滑动在磁性状态之间切换石墨烯</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/electrical-sliding-switches-graphene-between-magnetic-states</link><description>康奈尔大学的研究人员发现，通过电滑动超薄石墨烯层可以使材料在不同的磁态之间切换，即使在电压移除后，这些磁态仍会持续存在，这一发现可能提供一种控制二维材料量子特性的新方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/electrical-sliding-switches-graphene-between-magnetic-states.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:34:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/electrical-sliding-switches-graphene-between-magnetic-states</guid></item><item><title>DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017：愿望驱动的编程成为现实</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017-wish-driven-programming-made-real</link><description>🚀 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 来了！ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017-wish-driven-programming-made-real2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:19:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017-wish-driven-programming-made-real</guid></item><item><title>Roshi Jundo Cohen 谈禅宗、人工智能、超人类主义和拯救世界</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/roshi-jundo-cohen-on-zen-ai-transhumanism-and-saving-the-world</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/roshi-jundo-cohen-on-zen-ai-transhumanism-and-saving-the-world.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:04:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/roshi-jundo-cohen-on-zen-ai-transhumanism-and-saving-the-world</guid></item><item><title>南加州大学的科学家发现如何创造源源不断的抗癌细胞</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/usc-scientists-discover-how-to-create-a-never-ending-supply-of-cancer-fighting-cells</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/usc-scientists-discover-how-to-create-a-never-ending-supply-of-cancer-fighting-cells.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:49:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/usc-scientists-discover-how-to-create-a-never-ending-supply-of-cancer-fighting-cells</guid></item><item><title>个性化 CRISPR 疗法可能很快就会惠及数千人——具体方法如下</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/personalized-crispr-therapies-could-soon-reach-thousands-heres-how</link><description>Urnov 和 Kassim 提出了监管框架，以帮助向需要的罕见疾病患者传播个性化 CRISPR 治疗。如果没有更好的监管，每次引导RNA核苷酸的改变都需要一个漫长（约4年）的过程才能获得批准。许多罕见疾病进展很快，因此这个时期对于患者来说往往是致命的。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/personalized-crispr-therapies-could-soon-reach-thousands-heres-how.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:34:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/personalized-crispr-therapies-could-soon-reach-thousands-heres-how</guid></item><item><title>持续多轮压力下的法学硕士阿谀奉承</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/llm-sycophancy-under-sustained-multi-turn-pressure</link><description>一个名为 SPINE 的新基准调查了大型语言模型 (LLM) 中一个微妙但重要的弱点：阿谀奉承，或者同意用户的倾向，即使这样做意味着放弃正确的立场。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:19:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/llm-sycophancy-under-sustained-multi-turn-pressure</guid></item><item><title>“这些都是惊人的预测”：超级厄尔尼诺现象的可能性越来越大，可能会带来人道主义危机</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/these-are-striking-forecasts-super-el-nino-keeps-getting-even-more-likely-and-it-could-bring-a-humanitarian-crisis</link><description>预测显示，持续的厄尔尼诺现象在未来几个月内将迅速加强，可能创下历史新高，从而加剧气温上升和极端天气。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/these-are-striking-forecasts-super-el-nino-keeps-getting-even-more-likely-and-it-could-bring-a-humanitarian-crisis.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:04:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/these-are-striking-forecasts-super-el-nino-keeps-getting-even-more-likely-and-it-could-bring-a-humanitarian-crisis</guid></item><item><title>当人工智能与人类世界碰撞时</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/when-ai-human-worlds-collide</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:49:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/when-ai-human-worlds-collide</guid></item><item><title>利用光控制脑细胞解释了他如何获得诺贝尔奖的发现</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/using-light-to-control-brain-cells-explains-how-he-made-his-nobel-winning-discovery</link><description>2026年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/using-light-to-control-brain-cells-explains-how-he-made-his-nobel-winning-discovery.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:34:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/using-light-to-control-brain-cells-explains-how-he-made-his-nobel-winning-discovery</guid></item><item><title>阿尔茨海默氏症的隐藏数学可能会带来新的治疗方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-hidden-math-of-alzheimers-could-point-to-new-treatments</link><description>数学可能为理解阿尔茨海默病提供意想不到的线索。科学家们开发了一个模型，展示铜和锌等常见金属如何影响与疾病相关的蛋白质的积累，同时还探索阻止这一过程的可能方法。这些发现可以帮助研究人员确定预防有害斑块形成的有前景的策略。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-hidden-math-of-alzheimers-could-point-to-new-treatments.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:19:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-hidden-math-of-alzheimers-could-point-to-new-treatments</guid></item></channel></rss>